{
  "_comment": [
    "SeaweedFS 的 S3 身分設定。複製成同目錄的 s3.config 再填入自己的金鑰 ——",
    "s3.config 已列入 .gitignore，不會進版控。",
    "",
    "產生金鑰：",
    "  openssl rand -hex 8    # accessKey",
    "  openssl rand -hex 16   # secretKey",
    "",
    "loki 這組身分的 accessKey / secretKey 會在 bootstrap 中被取出，",
    "寫成 observability 命名空間的 loki-s3-credentials secret。"
  ],
  "identities": [
    {
      "name": "anvAdmin",
      "credentials": [
        {
          "accessKey": "REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_KEY",
          "secretKey": "REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_SECRET_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "actions": ["Admin", "Read", "Write"]
    },
    {
      "name": "anvReadOnly",
      "credentials": [
        {
          "accessKey": "REPLACE_WITH_READONLY_ACCESS_KEY",
          "secretKey": "REPLACE_WITH_READONLY_SECRET_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "actions": ["Read"]
    },
    {
      "name": "loki",
      "credentials": [
        {
          "accessKey": "REPLACE_WITH_LOKI_ACCESS_KEY",
          "secretKey": "REPLACE_WITH_LOKI_SECRET_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "actions": ["Read:loki-chunks", "Write:loki-chunks", "List:loki-chunks"]
    }
  ]
}
